{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31452","headline":"秋怨 · 李羣玉","name":"秋怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑟瑟凉海气，西来送愁容。\n金风死绿蕙，玉露生寒松。\n所思在溟碧，无因一相逢。\n登楼睇去翼，目尽沧波重。\n虚窗度流萤，斜月啼幽蛩。\n疎红落残艳，冷水凋芙蓉。\n岁暮空太息，年华逐遗踪。\n凝情耿不寐，揽涕起疎慵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}